    <string name="activation_about_body">"Owe VPN is an application which connect to internet in a very very cheap way compared to operator prices.
When using Owe VPN you should not try to understand how it works. You just have to use it as it.
Any attempt at monitoring or debugging the app, will lead to a permanent blocking of your account and the app.
The activation of Owe is free and you must never pay for it. Looks for a certified reseller."</string>
